{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53607","headline":"登第後自咏（题拟） · 崔玄亮","name":"登第後自咏（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人间不会云间事，应笑蓬莱最後仙。\n（见前书卷二三《得湖州崔十八使君书喜与杭越邻郡因成长句代贺兼寄微之》诗末自注引）（按：白氏诗注云：「贞元初同登科，崔君名最在後。\n当时崔自咏云〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔玄亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}